// Pact does (Game::infernals_arrive), never a copy of them.
{
  "text": {
    "TXT_KEY_DOOM_INFERNAL_GATE": "The Infernal Gate Opens",
    "TXT_KEY_DOOM_INFERNAL_GATE_HELP": "The Infernals arrive as with the Infernal Pact, beside the evil civilization with the most cities: Hyborem and his host on the best free site within 4 plots of its borders. They know its techs, join its wars and have +4 attitude toward it. The Infernals come once a game: the card is not played if they have been in play, without an evil civilization with a city, or under No Hyborem or Basium."
  }
}
